<text font-family="sans-serif" font-size="14px" fill="black" x="230" y="248">Steele, Norman W: Seattle F Design, Nov 68</text>
<text font-family="sans-serif" font-size="14px" fill="black" x="230" y="266">Borderline classification, could be cushion rectangle</text>
<text font-family="sans-serif" font-size="14px" fill="black" x="230" y="284">or barrell.</text>
